OL,3,ATwelve killed and 300 injured in attack
OL,4,Aon airport in Saudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt least 12 people have been killed and
OL,7,Fmore than 300 injured in Saturday's
OL,8,Fattack on King Khalid International
OL,9,FAirport in Riyadh, Saudi Arabia
OL,11,FFour Saudis, two people from Bangladesh
OL,12,Fand one person each from the US,
OL,13,FJordan, Palestine, Syria, Sudan and
OL,14,FEgypt were killed, the Saudi civil
OL,15,Faviation authority says
OL,17,F"Everyone was running," an eyewitness
OL,18,Fwho was at the airport says - video
OL,19,Ffootage shows smoke rising after the
OL,20,Fattack
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
