OL,3,ATwelve killed and 300 injured in attack
OL,4,Aon airport in Saudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Saudi-led coalition labelled the
OL,7,Fincident a "war crime" and has blamed
OL,8,FYemen's Houthis - who have not
OL,9,Fcommented on Saturday's attack but did
OL,10,Fsay they were behind separate strikes
OL,11,Fon the same airport on Thursday
